## 1. Introduction

This document defines the confirmed requirements for a personal, offline, single-user desktop application for tracking study sessions. The application gamifies studying by awarding XP for completed study time and medals for daily study milestones.

The application shall be implemented in Python using CustomTkinter for the GUI. It shall be packageable into a standalone Windows executable and shall not require an installed Python environment on the target machine.

All user data shall be stored locally. The application shall not depend on any external server, network service, telemetry system, cloud storage, or remote authentication mechanism.

This document includes the confirmed decisions for ambiguous areas, including XP calculation, midnight-crossing sessions, week definition, streak behavior, save file location, backup handling, and asset handling.

