## 2. Glossary

| Term | Definition |
|---|---|
| Session | A single logged period of study with a duration and timestamp. |
| XP | Experience points awarded for completed study time. |
| Medal | A daily award based on total study time for a calendar day. |
| Calendar Day | A local date from midnight to midnight, according to the user’s system clock. |
| Day Attribution | The rule that determines which calendar day a session counts toward. |
| Streak | A count of consecutive qualifying study days. |
| Qualifying Day | A calendar day that counts toward a streak. |
| Active Day | A calendar day with at least one logged session. |
| Save File | The local JSON file containing user data and settings. |
| Backup File | A local copy of the last known good save file. |
| Frozen App | The application when packaged into a standalone executable. |
| Preset Session | A session logged using one of the predefined duration buttons. |
| Custom Session | A session logged using user-entered hours and minutes. |

