| FR-69 | Corrupt or unloadable save files shall be preserved or quarantined for diagnosis. | The app should avoid overwriting them immediately. |
| FR-70 | The save file shall include a schema version field. | The initial schema version is 1. |
| FR-71 | The application shall handle missing schema version fields gracefully. | For v1, missing version may be treated as version 1 if otherwise valid. |
