## 10. Proposed Save File Data Schema

The save file shall be JSON-based. Derived values such as daily totals, medals, streaks, and statistics should be computed from sessions at runtime rather than stored as authoritative records. This reduces the risk of stale or inconsistent derived data.

### 10.1 General Schema Rules

| ID | Requirement | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| DATA-1 | The save file shall contain a top-level schema version field. | Initial version is 1. |
| DATA-2 | The save file shall contain application settings and session records. | Derived data is not required to be stored. |
| DATA-3 | The application shall tolerate missing optional fields by using safe defaults. | This supports forward compatibility and user editing. |
| DATA-4 | Date and time values shall be stored as local date-time values in ISO-style format. | The exact serialization format should be stable and parseable. |
| DATA-5 | Derived daily medal state shall not be the primary source of truth. | Medals are calculated from sessions. |
| DATA-6 | Session identifiers shall be unique. | A UUID or equivalent unique string is recommended. |

### 10.2 Top-Level Fields

| Field | Type | Required | Description |
|---|---|---|---|
| schema_version | Integer | Yes | Save file schema version. Initial value is 1. |
| created_at | Date-time | Optional | Timestamp when the save file was created. |
| updated_at | Date-time | Optional | Timestamp when the save file was last written. |
| settings | Object | Yes | User settings and configuration. |
| sessions | Array | Yes | List of session records. Empty on first run. |

### 10.3 Settings Fields

| Field | Type | Required | Default | Description |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| theme | String | Yes | dark | Either dark or light. |
| xp_per_10_minutes | Integer | Yes | 10 | XP awarded per completed 10-minute study block. |

### 10.4 Session Fields

| Field | Type | Required | Description |
|---|---|---|---|
| id | String | Yes | Unique session identifier. |
| start_local | Date-time | Yes | Local start date and time of the session. |
| end_local | Date-time | Optional | Local end date and time. Can be derived from start and duration. |
| duration_minutes | Integer | Yes | Total session duration in minutes. |
| created_at_local | Date-time | Optional | Timestamp when the session was logged. |
| source | String | Optional | Indicates whether session was preset or custom. Not required for core logic. |

### 10.5 Derived Data Policy

| Derived Data | Stored Persistently? | Calculation Source |
|---|---|---|
| Daily total study time | No | Sessions attributed to the day |
| Daily XP | No | Sessions attributed to the day |
| Daily medal | No | Daily total study time |
| Calendar medal icons | No | Daily medal calculation |
| Today / week / month / lifetime stats | No | Session history |
| Current streak | No | Qualifying day history |
| Longest streak | No | Qualifying day history |
| Medal counts | No | Daily medal history |

